{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/947904-beings-that-generates-paradox","id":947904,"title":"Beings that generates paradox?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-08-10T11:33:13-07:00","id":947904,"title":"Beings that generates paradox?","content":"is it limited to humans or would it also encompass other mortal sentient beings such as off world Aliens? What about human mortals with second sight psychic merits?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12063-seta143","name":"Seta143","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T11:37:39-07:00","id":947908,"title":"","content":"Is this for first or second edition?<br /> <br /> For 2nd:<br /> Any mortal with a Supernatural merit counts as a Sleepwalker, so no Paradox. Since some of the powers from Second Sight are now included as Supernatural merits in core, I'd say that any other psychic merits that haven't been updated counts.<br /> <br /> Aliens is more of a question, do they have souls? and if they do does it have a shard of the Abyss? STs call until/unless a book comes out dealing with it.<br /> <br /> I don't know first edition so I don't know there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T11:38:53-07:00","id":947909,"title":"","content":"Abyssal entities can add to your Paradox pool.<br /> <br /> Mortals with supernatural powers count as Sleepwalkers. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1329_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1329\" data-vbnamecard=\"1329\">ElvesofZion</a> that was the case in 1e too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T11:41:00-07:00","id":947910,"title":"","content":"i'm asking for first edition, haven't gotten any of the 2nd e books yet<br /> <br /> What about humans that are Redeemed Prometheans? \u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12063,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12063-seta143","user":"Seta143","date":". 08-10-2016, 02:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12063-seta143","name":"Seta143","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T11:57:59-07:00","id":947925,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Seta143</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/947904-beings-that-generates-paradox?p=947910#post947910\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">i'm asking for first edition, haven't gotten any of the 2nd e books yet<br /> <br /> What about humans that are Redeemed Prometheans? \u200b</div> </div> </div> </div>Some redeemed Prometheans possess supernatural abilities - those are definitely Sleepwalkers. As for the rest, I don't know. I guess it depends.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5973-prometheus","name":"Prometheus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5973_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T12:03:09-07:00","id":947929,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prometheus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/947904-beings-that-generates-paradox?p=947925#post947925\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Some redeemed Prometheans possess supernatural abilities - those are definitely Sleepwalkers. As for the rest, I don't know. I guess it depends.</div> </div> </div> </div>What if they remember their time as a promethean but have no type of supernatural ability or boon?<br /> <br /> What if they don't remember being a Promethean at all but do have some type of passive boon even they don't know about?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12063-seta143","name":"Seta143","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T12:05:42-07:00","id":947934,"title":"","content":"Mage 2E is clear in that if you have *any* supernatural ability at all (Not just, say, being possessed. An actual innate power.), you are a Sleepwalker. Personal awareness about that ability or boon shouldn't really matter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5973,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5973-prometheus","user":"Prometheus","date":". 08-10-2016, 03:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5973-prometheus","name":"Prometheus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5973_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T12:33:48-07:00","id":947954,"title":"","content":"STs should use reason when adjudicating. There are obvious exceptions, such as humans whose supernatural abilities come from the Abyss.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Grump, grouse, and/or gripe.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.